{"hw":"ἁβρύνω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἁβρύνω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἁβρ-ύνω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἁβρός</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make delicate, treat delicately,</b> <span class=\"gk\">μὴ γυναικὸς ἐν τρόποις ἐμὲ ἅβρυνε&lt;*</span> A <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">919</span> </span>: <b class=\"lex-tr\">deck out,</b> <span class=\"gk\">εἰς γάμον ἁβρῦναί τινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.281</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Leon.</span> </span>):—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span> or <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">live delicately</b>; hence, <b class=\"lex-tr\">wax wanton, give oneself airs,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἁβρύνεται γὰρ πᾶς τις εὖ πράσσων πλέον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1205</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1339</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐκαλλυνόμην τε καὶ ἡβρυνόμην ἄν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20c</span> </span>: c. dat. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">pride, plume oneself on a</b> thing, <span class=\"gk\">οὐχ ἁβρύνομαι τῷδ'</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">858</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡβρύνετο τῷ βραδέως διαπράττειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ages.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.2</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἷς ὁ τῶν γυναικῶν ἁβρύνεται βίος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Clearch.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>.</div></div>"}